{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "conditional",
      "when": {
        "source": {
          "kind": "stream",
          "event": "capabilities",
          "path": "connected"
        },
        "op": "eq",
        "value": false
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "section",
          "title": "Not connected to a machine",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "note",
              "title": "This module works through a machine you are connected to",
              "lines": [
                "It reaches the rest of your network from there: SSH to find machines and install the agent, then HTTP to everything the agent runs.",
                "Connect to a machine on the same network as the fleet - the machine list is in the sidebar - and this page fills in by itself."
              ],
              "tone": "info"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "else": [
        {
          "type": "conditional",
          "when": {
            "source": {
              "kind": "stream",
              "event": "capabilities",
              "path": "problem"
            },
            "op": "exists"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "section",
              "title": "This machine cannot reach the fleet",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "keyValue",
                  "source": {
                    "kind": "stream",
                    "event": "capabilities"
                  },
                  "rows": [
                    {
                      "key": "sshVersion",
                      "label": "SSH client"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "problem",
                      "label": "Problem"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "title": "What to do",
                  "lines": [
                    "Something the module cannot work without is missing on the machine you are connected to, so nothing has been read and no figure below would be real.",
                    "Module settings lists every tool it looks for. Install the missing ones there, or connect to a machine that already has them."
                  ],
                  "tone": "warning"
                },
                {
                  "type": "actions",
                  "actions": [
                    {
                      "label": "Check again",
                      "method": "sweepNow"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "type": "conditional",
              "when": {
                "source": {
                  "kind": "stream",
                  "event": "capabilities",
                  "path": "warning"
                },
                "op": "exists"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "title": "Working, with something worth knowing",
                  "lines": [
                    "The fleet is being read, and one thing about the machine you are connected to makes it slower or less precise than it could be. Module settings names it."
                  ],
                  "tone": "warning"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "subnav",
              "items": [
                {
                  "id": "instances",
                  "label": "Deployed",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "conditional",
                      "when": {
                        "source": {
                          "kind": "stream",
                          "event": "ui",
                          "path": "hintsOn"
                        },
                        "op": "eq",
                        "value": true
                      },
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "note",
                          "title": "What a row is",
                          "lines": [
                            "One service on one machine. Tick several to act on them together - the toolbar acts on exactly what is ticked.",
                            "Degraded means the service is working but something optional is not: PacketStream without its watchtower, for instance, is still earning and simply is not updating itself."
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "section",
                      "title": "Everything deployed",
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "table",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "invoke",
                            "method": "instanceRows",
                            "intervalKey": "service-fleet"
                          },
                          "columns": [
                            {
                              "key": "ip",
                              "label": "Machine"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "label",
                              "label": "Label"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "displayName",
                              "label": "Service"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "template",
                              "label": "Template id"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "kind",
                              "label": "Kind"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "stateBadges",
                              "label": "State",
                              "format": "badges",
                              "sortable": false
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "state",
                              "label": "State name"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "unitBadges",
                              "label": "Units",
                              "format": "badges",
                              "sortable": false
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "restarts",
                              "label": "Restarts",
                              "align": "right"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "updatedAt",
                              "label": "Changed",
                              "format": "time"
                            }
                          ],
                          "rowKey": "key",
                          "selectable": true,
                          "sortDefault": {
                            "key": "ip",
                            "dir": "asc"
                          },
                          "filterKeys": [
                            "ip",
                            "label",
                            "template",
                            "displayName",
                            "state"
                          ],
                          "groupModes": [
                            {
                              "id": "machine",
                              "label": "By machine",
                              "key": "ip"
                            },
                            {
                              "id": "template",
                              "label": "By service",
                              "key": "template"
                            },
                            {
                              "id": "state",
                              "label": "By state",
                              "key": "state"
                            }
                          ],
                          "rowActions": [
                            {
                              "label": "Restart",
                              "method": "instanceAction",
                              "argsFromRow": [
                                "key"
                              ],
                              "args": [
                                "restart"
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "label": "Validate",
                              "method": "instanceAction",
                              "argsFromRow": [
                                "key"
                              ],
                              "args": [
                                "validate"
                              ]
                            }
                          ],
                          "bulkActions": [
                            {
                              "label": "Start",
                              "method": "bulkInstanceAction",
                              "args": [
                                "start"
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "label": "Restart",
                              "method": "bulkInstanceAction",
                              "args": [
                                "restart"
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "label": "Validate",
                              "method": "bulkInstanceAction",
                              "args": [
                                "validate"
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "label": "Stop",
                              "method": "bulkInstanceAction",
                              "args": [
                                "stop"
                              ],
                              "confirm": "Stop the ticked services? They stop earning until they are started again.",
                              "kind": "danger"
                            },
                            {
                              "label": "Uninstall",
                              "method": "bulkInstanceAction",
                              "args": [
                                "uninstall"
                              ],
                              "confirm": "Remove the ticked services from their machines? Stored credentials are kept unless you remove the agent too.",
                              "kind": "danger"
                            }
                          ],
                          "rowDetail": [
                            {
                              "type": "section",
                              "title": "This service",
                              "blocks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "actions",
                                  "actions": [
                                    {
                                      "label": "Start",
                                      "method": "instanceAction",
                                      "argsFromRow": [
                                        "key"
                                      ],
                                      "args": [
                                        "start"
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "label": "Restart",
                                      "method": "instanceAction",
                                      "argsFromRow": [
                                        "key"
                                      ],
                                      "args": [
                                        "restart"
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "label": "Validate",
                                      "method": "instanceAction",
                                      "argsFromRow": [
                                        "key"
                                      ],
                                      "args": [
                                        "validate"
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "label": "Stop",
                                      "method": "instanceAction",
                                      "argsFromRow": [
                                        "key"
                                      ],
                                      "args": [
                                        "stop"
                                      ],
                                      "confirm": "Stop this service?",
                                      "kind": "danger"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "label": "Uninstall",
                                      "method": "instanceAction",
                                      "argsFromRow": [
                                        "key"
                                      ],
                                      "args": [
                                        "uninstall"
                                      ],
                                      "confirm": "Remove this service from the machine?",
                                      "kind": "danger"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "section",
                              "title": "Recent log",
                              "blocks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "conditional",
                                  "when": {
                                    "source": {
                                      "kind": "stream",
                                      "event": "ui",
                                      "path": "hintsOn"
                                    },
                                    "op": "eq",
                                    "value": true
                                  },
                                  "blocks": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "note",
                                      "title": "Where this comes from",
                                      "lines": [
                                        "The agent reads it from Docker or the journal and masks anything that looks like a secret before it leaves the machine. It is a snapshot, not a live tail."
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "keyValue",
                                  "source": {
                                    "kind": "invoke",
                                    "method": "instanceLogs",
                                    "args": [
                                      "$row.key"
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  "rows": [
                                    {
                                      "key": "unit",
                                      "label": "Unit"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "key": "error",
                                      "label": "Problem"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "list",
                                  "source": {
                                    "kind": "invoke",
                                    "method": "instanceLogs",
                                    "args": [
                                      "$row.key"
                                    ],
                                    "path": "lines"
                                  },
                                  "columns": [
                                    {
                                      "key": "line"
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "limit": 200,
                                  "emptyText": "Nothing in the log yet, or the agent could not be reached."
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ],
                          "emptyText": "Nothing is deployed anywhere yet. Use Deploy to put a service on some machines."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "deploy",
                  "label": "Deploy",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "note",
                      "title": "How deploying works",
                      "lines": [
                        "A template is pushed to each machine you choose, and then installed from. Pushing happens every time, so editing a template and deploying again is how a change reaches the fleet.",
                        "A machine already running this service is reinstalled rather than given a second copy."
                      ],
                      "tone": "info"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "section",
                      "title": "Deploy a service",
                      "columns": 2,
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "conditional",
                          "when": {
                            "source": {
                              "kind": "stream",
                              "event": "ui",
                              "path": "hintsOn"
                            },
                            "op": "eq",
                            "value": true
                          },
                          "blocks": [
                            {
                              "type": "note",
                              "title": "What each field means",
                              "lines": [
                                "Service - which template to deploy. Templates that ship with the module and ones you wrote are both here.",
                                "Machines - which agents to put it on. Only machines with a working agent token are offered.",
                                "The remaining fields are whatever that template asks for - an account email, a password, a device name. They are checked before anything is sent, and secret ones are stored on each machine unencrypted, which the check step says again before you apply."
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "checkForm",
                          "checkMethod": "deployCheck",
                          "applyMethod": "deployApply",
                          "fields": [
                            {
                              "key": "template",
                              "label": "Service",
                              "input": "select",
                              "optionsFrom": {
                                "kind": "invoke",
                                "method": "selectOptions",
                                "args": [
                                  "templates"
                                ]
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "machines",
                              "label": "Machines",
                              "input": "select",
                              "multiple": true,
                              "optionsFrom": {
                                "kind": "invoke",
                                "method": "agentOptions"
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "field_email",
                              "label": "Account email",
                              "input": "text"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "field_password",
                              "label": "Password",
                              "input": "password",
                              "omitOnApply": true
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "field_device",
                              "label": "Device name",
                              "input": "text"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "field_device_name",
                              "label": "Device name (Pawns)",
                              "input": "text"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "field_device_id",
                              "label": "Device id (Pawns)",
                              "input": "text"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "field_cid",
                              "label": "CID (PacketStream)",
                              "input": "password",
                              "omitOnApply": true
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "field_binary_url",
                              "label": "Download URL (native templates)",
                              "input": "text"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "field_binary_sha256",
                              "label": "SHA-256 of that file",
                              "input": "text"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "field_package",
                              "label": "Package name (apt template)",
                              "input": "text"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "field_arguments",
                              "label": "Arguments",
                              "input": "text"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "field_extra_environment",
                              "label": "Environment line",
                              "input": "text"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "field_unit_name",
                              "label": "Unit the package installs",
                              "input": "text"
                            }
                          ],
                          "checkLabel": "Check the plan",
                          "applyLabel": "Deploy"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "section",
                      "title": "Which fields this service uses",
                      "columns": 2,
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "conditional",
                          "when": {
                            "source": {
                              "kind": "stream",
                              "event": "ui",
                              "path": "hintsOn"
                            },
                            "op": "eq",
                            "value": true
                          },
                          "blocks": [
                            {
                              "type": "note",
                              "title": "Why every field is shown",
                              "lines": [
                                "A form is fixed JSON, and which values a template needs is not known until one is chosen - so every field any shipped template asks for is listed above, and the ones your chosen template does not use are ignored.",
                                "This table is the authority: it lists exactly what the selected service asks for, whether each is required, and which are stored as secrets."
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "table",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "invoke",
                            "method": "templateFields",
                            "args": [
                              "$form.template"
                            ]
                          },
                          "columns": [
                            {
                              "key": "label",
                              "label": "Field"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "key",
                              "label": "Fill in"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "required",
                              "label": "Required"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "secret",
                              "label": "Secret"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "default",
                              "label": "Default"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "help",
                              "label": "What it is"
                            }
                          ],
                          "rowKey": "key",
                          "emptyText": "Choose a service above to see what it asks for."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
